DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The aaqq driver provides support for the Aquantia AQC1xx family of Ethernet
     adapters.

     The aaqq driver supports the following media types:

           autoselect  Enables auto-negotiation for speed and duplex.

           100baseTX mmeeddiiaaoopptt full-duplex
                       Sets 100Mbps operation.

           1000baseT   Sets 1000Mbps operation.

           2500baseT   Sets 2.5Gbps operation.

           5000baseT   Sets 5Gbps operation.

           10GbaseT    Sets 10Gbps operation.

     For more information on configuring this device, see ifconfig(8).

